                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor User as :Usuário (B2C/B2B)\n    participant Controller as :ForumController\n    participant Service as :ForumService\n    participant UserRepo as :UserRepository\n    participant ForumRepo as :ForumRepository\n    participant DB as :PostgreSQL (Docker)\n\n    User-&gt;&gt;Controller: 1. Request Acesso (GET /api/forums/{id})\n    activate Controller\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: 2. ObterForumRestrito(userId, forumId)\n    activate Service\n\n    Service-&gt;&gt;UserRepo: 3. ObterPerfilUsuario(userId)\n    activate UserRepo\n    UserRepo-&gt;&gt;DB: 4. SELECT (via Entity Framework)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;UserRepo: 5. Dados (Idade, Status Laudo/Credencial)\n    UserRepo--&gt;&gt;Service: 6. Retorna Entidade Usuario\n    deactivate UserRepo\n\n    Note over Service: 7. Executa RN01 (Laudo) e RN03 (Idade)\n\n    alt Sem Laudo ou Idade Insuficiente\n        Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: 8a. Lança Exceção (Acesso Negado)\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;User: 9a. Retorna Erro 403 Forbidden\n    else Laudo/Credencial Válida e Idade OK\n        Service-&gt;&gt;ForumRepo: 8b. ObterConteudoForum(forumId)\n        activate ForumRepo\n        ForumRepo-&gt;&gt;DB: 9b. SELECT (via Entity Framework)\n        DB--&gt;&gt;ForumRepo: 10. Dados do Fórum\n        ForumRepo--&gt;&gt;Service: 11. Retorna Entidade Forum\n        deactivate ForumRepo\n        Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: 12. Retorna DTO do Fórum\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;User: 13. Retorna 200 OK + Conteúdo\n    end\n\n    deactivate Service\n    deactivate Controller&quot;&#xa;}" id="2">
